Variable CO2e_per_System_per1
Title: CO2e per System per Year (scenario modified)
Definition: CO2e_per_System_per_ ~
	- ((Shipment_CO2e_Reduc1 * LOG_Ext_Scenario_Com[LOG_Interventions='Shipment CO2e Reduction']) +~
	 (Inbound_CO2e_Reducti * LOG_Ext_Scenario_Com[LOG_Interventions='Inbound CO2e Reduction']) +~
	 (Service_CO2e_Reducti * LOG_Ext_Scenario_Com[LOG_Interventions='Service CO2e Reduction']))
